  "Decision": "Adopt revised trial for measured horizontal-sampling fidelity, retaining all costs. Skipping unused analytic coordinates is exactly output-equivalent; separate unpaired timing batches do not prove it accelerates rendering.",
  "Meaning": "Ten static views improve against the same adapted reference; frozen input315 ceiling68 disagreement falls4167 to2270. HUD stays exact. Derived reference column equality is narrow arithmetic agreement, not independently logged original column calls or original executable proof. Analytic wall scale/coverage, lighting, BSP and moving-world differences remain. Actual workers preserve Classic/Matrix/AnsiArt including palette/fuzz. All36 maps have bounded idle renders, not navigation or completion. Six serial60-call ABBA datasets retain initial calls/outliers; class-based revised later cycles range-0.29% to+16.66%, E3M6+6.48/+8.83%. Final numeric later cycles range+0.18% to+1.56%, with initial-call asymmetry retained. Across unpaired batches these numbers do not isolate a causal optimization gain. Native pacing/audio/simulation/worker contention are outside these calls; full performance gates remain unpassed. No route expectations tuned. No current-build live recording or acoustic/original-frame/campaign claim.",
  "Failures": "First worker integration fails because separate rendering processes intentionally do not load engine Trig/Fixed/Angle/Geometry classes. Retain failed Classic log and exact class-based renderer; replace only segment parameter preparation with numeric PowerShell, transport fine-tangent data, and compare all returned parameters/output. First parameter harness sees11 different outer exception wrapper types at extreme int32 coordinates, with neither implementation returning values. Retain its report and source; compare innermost cause types after tracing their identical OverflowException chains. Fresh test retains11 matching failures alongside20038 exact returned cases.",
